And the higher rated you are, the wider

00:36:25.950 --> 00:36:28.470
and broader your chess education and

00:36:28.470 --> 00:36:30.170
your chess knowledge has to be, because

00:36:30.170 --> 00:36:31.910
you're going to get more and more

00:36:31.910 --> 00:36:34.190
diverse types of positions out of the

00:36:34.190 --> 00:36:35.370
